---
source: crates/jailint/tests/rules.rs
---
error[misrefactored_assign_op]: `total += total + ...` applies `+` to `total` twice
  --> tests/lint/misrefactored_assign_op/bad.jai:9:5
   |
 9 |     total += total + 5;
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: `+=` already starts from `total`: write `total += 5`
   |
 8       total := 0;
 9 ~     total += 5;
10       s: State;
   |
   = note: `misrefactored_assign_op` is `deny` by default
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/misrefactored_assign_op

error[misrefactored_assign_op]: `s.score *= s.score * ...` applies `*` to `s.score` twice
  --> tests/lint/misrefactored_assign_op/bad.jai:11:5
   |
11 |     s.score *= s.score * 2;
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: `*=` already starts from `s.score`: write `s.score *= 2`
   |
10       s: State;
11 ~     s.score *= 2;
12       mask: u32 = 0xF0;
   |
   = note: `misrefactored_assign_op` is `deny` by default
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/misrefactored_assign_op

error[misrefactored_assign_op]: `mask |= mask | ...` applies `|` to `mask` twice
  --> tests/lint/misrefactored_assign_op/bad.jai:13:5
   |
13 |     mask |= 1 | mask;
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: `|=` already starts from `mask`: write `mask |= 1`
   |
12       mask: u32 = 0xF0;
13 ~     mask |= 1;
14       f := 1.5;
   |
   = note: `misrefactored_assign_op` is `deny` by default
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/misrefactored_assign_op

error[misrefactored_assign_op]: `f -= f - ...` applies `-` to `f` twice
  --> tests/lint/misrefactored_assign_op/bad.jai:15:5
   |
15 |     f -= f - 0.5;
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: `-=` already starts from `f`: write `f -= 0.5`
   |
14       f := 1.5;
15 ~     f -= 0.5;
16       xs: [4] int;
   |
   = note: `misrefactored_assign_op` is `deny` by default
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/misrefactored_assign_op

error[misrefactored_assign_op]: `xs[i] += xs[i] + ...` applies `+` to `xs[i]` twice
  --> tests/lint/misrefactored_assign_op/bad.jai:18:5
   |
18 |     xs[i] += xs[i] + 3;
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: `+=` already starts from `xs[i]`: write `xs[i] += 3`
   |
17       i := 1;
18 ~     xs[i] += 3;
19       print("% % % % %\n", total, s, mask, f, xs);
   |
   = note: `misrefactored_assign_op` is `deny` by default
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/misrefactored_assign_op
